# COSMIC (Wayland, System76's Rust desktop; packaged by Artix, no systemd)
cosmic-session
cosmic-terminal
cosmic-files
cosmic-text-editor
cosmic-viewer
cosmic-player
cosmic-monitor
cosmic-wallpapers
# COSMIC needs a Vulkan driver: without this, pacman would pick the first
# one it knows (an NVIDIA driver). The drivers step adds the right ones.
vulkan-swrast
network-manager-applet
blueman
adwaita-fonts
# secrets (passwords for apps; Plasma has its own)
gnome-keyring
